# Source files stay LF whatever the checkout platform. Windows editors and
# tooling will otherwise flip a file to CRLF on the first write and turn a
# three-line change into a whole-file diff.
#
# package.json and package-lock.json are deliberately left out: npm rewrites
# them with CRLF here, and normalising them would mean re-writing the lockfile
# for no benefit.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
